.TH fish 1 "FUZIX Games" "FUZIX"
.SH NAME
fish \- play Go Fish against the computer
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B fish
.SH DESCRIPTION
The Unix V7 card game.  The object is to collect books of four cards of
the same face value.  On your turn you ask for a value you hold; if the
computer has any it hands them all over and you ask again, and if not
it says GO FISH and you draw from the pool.  Draw the card you asked for
and you go again.
.PP
It asks first whether you want instructions; answer with Return alone,
or
.BR n ,
to skip them.
.SH PLAYING
Ask by typing
.BR a ,
.BR 2 " to " 10 ,
.BR j ,
.B q
or
.BR k .
Return on its own shows the size of the computer's hand and of the pool,
and the books it has made.
.B p
as your first guess of the game puts it on its professional level; the
default is easy to beat.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR backgammon (1),
.BR wump (1)
